"text": "Five lines. A tank pump feeds a cam-driven high-pressure pump. The rail holds fifty to two hundred bar, the injector tip in the chamber. Homogeneous mode injects during intake. Stratified mode injects late: rich at the plug, lean overall. Evaporation cools the air: a denser charge that resists knock.",
